WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:04.250
A research team is working to make water safer.

2
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:06.650
Their partners are in another country.

3
00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:12.260
Their work depends on being able to talk,
compare results, and keep learning together.

4
00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:17.700
Then, a decision in A blocks the addresses of
networks in B.

5
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.580
The infrastructure is still working.

6
00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.970
But the direct path between the teams is
blocked.

7
00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:26.800
A participant in C offers another path.

8
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:30.560
In PRP, one relationship can be carried by
another.

9
00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:33.900
For A, the direct relationship is with C.

10
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:38.900
B's identity does not appear as the source at
that transport layer.

11
00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:43.110
A persuades C to block B as well.

12
00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:46.790
That closes the direct path between B and C.

13
00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:52.500
But joining the blockade does not reveal the
origin of the relationships being carried.

14
00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.660
Now, D carries the relationship with B through a
relationship with C.

15
00:00:58.660 --> 00:00:59.960
C knows D.

16
00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:01.270
A knows C.

17
00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:03.450
The inner relationship remains protected.

18
00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:08.240
Blocking B by address is not enough to identify
this communication.

19
00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:12.050
Another participant can offer another layer.

20
00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:16.350
Stopping the communication means closing the
indirect paths too.

21
00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:21.620
That requires broader cooperation to enforce the
blockade, or cutting off

22
00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:24.010
intermediaries and affecting other people.

23
00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:28.910
This continuity depends on available paths and
willing participants.

24
00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:32.450
Closing every way out can still stop
communication.

25
00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:36.440
But blocking a country's addresses is no longer
enough.

26
00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:43.640
The sovereignty being protected is the freedom
to keep choosing your partners.

27
00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:45.220
Sovereignty without isolation.

28
00:01:45.220 --> 00:01:45.740
PRP.

